<div class="mw-parser-output"><h1>Ventriloquate</h1>
<p>Skill
Class: Thief (guild level 0)
</p><p>Usage:
</p>
<pre>ventriloquate &lt;someone or something&gt; &lt;words&gt;
</pre>
<p>Example:
</p>
<pre>ventriloquate guard The thief went that way!
ventriloquate statue Leave this place, mortal!
</pre>
<p>Throws your voice, so that someone or something in the room seems to 
speak your words. If it works, everyone else hears the guard (or the 
statue) say them, and the one you made speak hears only that someone 
said something. If it fails, everyone hears you say it, "in a funny way", 
and knows the trick was yours.
</p><p>Your brain and charisma, and your skill, decide it against those of the 
one you make speak; things that can't think are easy to speak through.
</p><p><br />
See Also:
</p>
<pre>&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Say</a>
&gt; <a cmd='#'>Help Thief Skills</a>
</pre>




</div>